  "body": "**Professionals Real Estate looks forward to welcoming you home.**\r\n\r\nOpportunities to secure a brand-new home in Orewa are not to be missed - and 17 Tamaota Terrace is ready for you to make your move.\r\n\r\nPositioned within the highly sought-after Ara Hills community, this thoughtfully designed home delivers modern style, quality and low-maintenance living in a location that continues to grow in popularity. Whether you're a first-home buyer, family or investor, this is an opportunity to secure a brand-new property without the wait.\r\n\r\nDesigned for effortless modern living, the home features light-filled open-plan spaces, quality finishes and smart, functional design throughout. Every detail has been carefully considered to create a home that is stylish, comfortable and easy to live in.\r\n\r\nFeaturing:\r\n*\tCedar and weatherboard cladding\r\n*\tThree generously sized bedrooms\r\n*\tPrimary suite with ensuite and walk-in wardrobe\r\n*\tSeparate study area\r\n*\tLight-filled open-plan kitchen, dining and living\r\n*\tQuality finishes throughout \r\n*\tDucted air-conditioning, Under-tile heating, Fully tiled bathrooms, LED mirrors, Bosch appliances\r\n\r\nThis is your chance to secure a brand-new home in one of Ara Hills' growing communities - offering the benefits of contemporary design, modern specifications and low-maintenance living from day one.\r\n\r\nWhether you're looking to take your first step onto the property ladder, find a modern family home or secure an investment for the future, this property offers an exciting combination of space, style and convenience.\r\n\r\nWith Ara Hills continuing to develop, now is the time to secure your place in this growing community. Enjoy a peaceful setting surrounded by natural landscapes while remaining close to Orewa Beach, local cafés, shops, quality schooling and excellent transport links connecting you to wider Auckland.\r\n\r\nDon't miss the opportunity to secure a brand-new home in Ara Hills. Get in touch with Sarah today to arrange your viewing and find out how you can make 17 Tamaota Terrace yours.\r\n\r\n**Experienced. Trusted. Consistent. Local Professionals.**\r\n\r\n**We believe real estate should be done better. Higher standards, clear communication, and proven systems are the reason our clients trust us to deliver, time and time again.**\r\n\r\n**If you are buying, selling, or looking for a better way to manage property, we would love to help. Backed by Meros Group, delivering a complete property solution - Sales, Rentals, Home Staging and Concierge.**\r\n\r\n**It's time for higher standards.**",
